I wake up in the morning hearing the loud sound of rain.
Rainwater is falling on the roof.
It is July now.
The monsoon has reached its peak condition.
It rained continuously here in the past few days.
It has rained a lot last night too.
I go to the kitchen.
I make a cup of hot coffee.
I come near the window with the coffee.
I look outside.
The rain has completely changed the city.
New leaves came on all the surrounding trees.
The whole city has become green now.
When I came to Kochi in January, it was very hot here.
That heat has changed now.
I like this monsoon season very much.
